442
00:49:37.470 --> 00:49:55.700
Michi Rossmeier: And they are really… and I always tell people also, just don't put your foot all the way in, just put the foot so that you have a little… maybe you touch it a bit, so that you know, of course, you have this support that you can even pull a little bit, but put it so that your toes are kind of outside

443
00:49:55.700 --> 00:50:01.279
