449
00:50:54.860 --> 00:50:58.049
Michi Rossmeier: Then usually writing will be, is more stable.

450
00:50:58.450 --> 00:51:11.269
Michi Rossmeier: And then you can always put foot straps, you just make them big enough so that always you just put your foot there, and you don't put it all the way in, that you can't get stuck, and… and then it's fine, you know? Then that's the only downside of foot straps, really,

451
00:51:12.050 --> 00:51:27.430
